    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULL EFFECT</strong> is wicked piece of software that ended up being a side scroller with FPS mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The idea is simple: complete your mission and run'n'gun everyone who opposes you. But beware: your foes are well-armed, malevolent and greatly outnumber <i>(but sometimes dumb)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the <strong>Ages</strong>: not a man, nor a machine, something in between and none of them at the same time <i>(but mostly simple humanoid, i'm not gonna lie)</i>, the one who possess enough strength and endurance for this task. Tough, but your enemies will not tolerate a skill issue: <strong>They Fear You Less Than You Fear Them</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game includes:</strong><br>- Fast gameplay that focuses on firefights: it's more a shooter than a platformer<br>- A challenging campaign that require a tenacity and tactical approach to complete<br>- Simple but varied arsenal of various weapons and equipment that you find along your way<br>- Malevolent bosses and enemies who are eager to stop you dead<br>- Replayability: difficulty settings, modifiers, New Game+, achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This experience may turn out to be the best or the worst in your life, like it wasn't happened before but yet again.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FULL EFFECT</strong> is wicked piece of software that ended up being a side scroller with FPS mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The idea is simple: complete your mission and run'n'gun everyone who opposes you. But beware: your foes are well-armed, malevolent and greatly outnumber <i>(but sometimes dumb)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the <strong>Ages</strong>: not a man, nor a machine, something in between and none of them at the same time <i>(but mostly simple humanoid, i'm not gonna lie)</i>, the one who possess enough strength and endurance for this task. Tough, but your enemies will not tolerate a skill issue: <strong>They Fear You Less Than You Fear Them</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game includes:</strong><br>- Fast gameplay that focuses on firefights: it's more a shooter than a platformer<br>- A challenging campaign that require a tenacity and tactical approach to complete<br>- Simple but varied arsenal of various weapons and equipment that you find along your way<br>- Malevolent bosses and enemies who are eager to stop you dead<br>- Replayability: difficulty settings, modifiers, New Game+, achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This experience may turn out to be the best or the worst in your life, like it wasn't happened before but yet again.</p>",
